Clone::clone takes &Self and gives back Self
   Clone::clone(&s)  s: String -> alloc::string::String, new buffer: true

Checkpoint. Ticket is not Clone. After `let b = a;` is `a` still usable?
   yes: a.seat = 12, b.seat = 12   (&Ticket is Copy, so `let b = a` copied it)

And Clone on the reference hands back the reference
   Clone::clone(&a)  a: &Ticket -> &Ticket, same address as a: true
